# Proxy the Founder Clarity Profile app from clarity-tools-two.vercel.app.
# 200! is a transparent rewrite (URL stays as clarityhub.com.au/founder-profile)
# and forces this rule to take precedence. The Next.js app sets basePath to
# /founder-profile so paths line up on both sides.
/founder-profile/*  https://clarity-tools-two.vercel.app/founder-profile/:splat  200!
/founder-profile    https://clarity-tools-two.vercel.app/founder-profile         200!
